
                                POWER RULEZ
				···········

                                Version 1.0
                         coded by : Kyle of ARÏSE

Requirements:
-Amiga
-/X (I coded it for 3.9, but it should work on other versions,too.)

Purpose:
The purpose is Power Rulez is to display som lines it takes randomly out
of a text file.
It is just a small gag, which I coded for Pater Pink's Power Board to make
the rulez even funnier...

Installation:
Just copy the following directories to you BBS directory:
<commands> and <doors>.
In doors you'll find the AREXX program, which you can adapt to your
desires (choose the number of rulez and the textfile).
Then enter <rulez> at the /X prompt.

